# Cloudflare Pages — SPA fallback.
#
# Angular routes like /gallery and /contact only exist in the browser. Without
# this rule a refresh or a shared deep link would ask Pages for a file that is
# not on disk and get a 404. Serving index.html with a 200 lets the Angular
# router take over and render the right page.
#
# Real files (JS, CSS, images) are matched first, so this only catches routes.
/*    /index.html   200
